<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Headings And Paragraphs</title>
</head>
<body>
    <h1>This is the biggesst heading</h1>
    <p>This is the paragraph for biggest heading.</p>
    <h2>This is a Sub-heading</h2>
    <p>This is paragraph for sub-heading.</p>
    <h3>This is even smaller but a heading</h3>
    <h4>This is even smaller but a heading</h4>
    <h5>This is even smaller but a heading</h5>
    <h6>This is the last stage of heading</h6>
    <p>Headings goes upto 6 levels and this is the paragraph for the 6th level heading</p>
</body>
</html>
